# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the AURORA sanitizer gate
# (scripts/aurora_gates.py). Every entry is a known, documented issue; see
# "Known issues found by the gates" in TESTING.md. Do not add an entry
# without documenting it there.

# The conservative stack scan reads a parked thread's whole stack block as
# glibc reports it, which includes the thread's static TLS block at the
# top; the parked thread keeps writing its own TLS (parking_lot's
# per-thread data while it waits). TESTING.md, issue "stack scan reads TLS".
race:*World*stack_words*
